Now I'll compile a complete research report with all the findings:

## Report: Icon/Logo Stylesheet Injection in Canvas-Theme-Editor

### 1. **syncIconAssetsFromEditor, getUsedIconCdnFiles, getUsedLogoCdnFiles, getIconCdnFile, buildSelectedAssetUrl, applyEditorTheme, Editor Event Hooks**

**File**: [packages/scaffold/templates/canvas-theme-editor/src/main.ts.tmpl](packages/scaffold/templates/canvas-theme-editor/src/main.ts.tmpl)

**Key Functions & Line Numbers:**

- **Line 118-128** — Import of `getIconCdnFile`, `getUsedIconCdnFiles`, `getLogoCdnFile`, `getUsedLogoCdnFiles`, `logos`, `products`:
  ```typescript
  getIconCdnFile,
  getUsedIconCdnFiles,
  getLogoCdnFile,
  getUsedLogoCdnFiles,
  ...
  logos,
  ...
  products,
  ```

- **Line 644-651** — `buildSelectedAssetUrl` function:
  ```typescript
  function buildSelectedAssetUrl(file: CdnFile): string {
    if (providerSelect.value !== LOCAL_PROVIDER_ID) {
      return buildFileUrl(file, providerSelect.value);
    }
    const localUrl = localAssetUrls[`/node_modules/${file.package}/${file.path}`];
    return localUrl ?? buildFileUrl(file);
  }
  ```

- **Line 678-697** — `applyEditorTheme` function:
  ```typescript
  function applyEditorTheme(editor: Editor | undefined): void {
    const css = editorThemeCss[selectedTheme];
    editorSkinStyle.textContent = css.skin;
    if (!editor) return;
    const editorDocument = editor.getDoc();
    if (!editorContentStyle || editorContentStyle.ownerDocument !== editorDocument) {
      editorContentStyle?.remove();
      editorContentStyle = editorDocument.createElement("style");
      editorDocument.head.append(editorContentStyle);
    }
    editorContentStyle.textContent = [css.content, PREVIEW_SCHEME_FORCE_CSS].join("\n");
    editorDocument.documentElement.dataset.pantokenScheme =
      document.documentElement.dataset.pantokenScheme;
  }
  ```

- **Line 1158-1172** — `syncIconAssetsFromEditor` function (the core problem):
  ```typescript
  function syncIconAssetsFromEditor(): boolean {
    const content = parseEditorHtml(getEditorHtml()).content;
    const iconAssetKeys = new Set(availableIcons.map((icon) => assetKey(getIconCdnFile(icon))));
    const logoAssetKeys = new Set(logos.map((logo) => assetKey(getLogoCdnFile(logo))));
    const nonSyncedAssets = currentAssets.filter(
      (asset) => !iconAssetKeys.has(assetKey(asset)) && !logoAssetKeys.has(assetKey(asset)),
    );
    const usedIconAssets = getUsedIconCdnFiles(content, availableIcons, currentAssets);
    const usedLogoAssets = getUsedLogoCdnFiles(content, logos);
    const nextAssets = [...nonSyncedAssets, ...usedIconAssets, ...usedLogoAssets];
    const changed = currentAssets.map(assetKey).join("\n") !== nextAssets.map(assetKey).join("\n");
    if (changed) currentAssets.splice(0, currentAssets.length, ...nextAssets);
    return changed;
  }
  ```
  **Problem**: Only updates `currentAssets` for preview; **does not inject stylesheets** into the editor iframe.

- **Line 1980-1985** — Setup event handler (where stylesheets ARE injected for pickers):
  ```typescript
  setup(editor: Editor): void {
    editor.on("input change Undo Redo SetContent", () => {
      syncThemeColorFromEditor();
      if (syncIconAssetsFromEditor()) void refreshAll();
      debouncedUpdatePreview();
    });
  }
  ```
  **Note**: This fires `SetContent`, `Undo`, `Redo`, `input`, `change` — but **misses** `Paste`, `PastePostProcess`, `resetContent()` events, and preset/draft restore logic.

- **Line 1994-2000** — Post-init draft restore:
  ```typescript
  if (isCanvasThemePreset(draft)) restoreCanvasThemePreset(draft);
  ...
  syncThemeColorFromEditor();
  syncIconAssetsFromEditor();
  ```
  **Problem**: Only calls `syncIconAssetsFromEditor()` on line 2000 to **update currentAssets** for preview; does **not trigger stylesheet injection** into the iframe.

- **Line 1248-1270** — `restoreCanvasThemePreset` function:
  ```typescript
  function restoreCanvasThemePreset(preset: CanvasThemePreset): void {
    if (!activeEditor || !isCanvasThemePreset(preset)) throw new TypeError("invalid-preset");
    // ... restore theme/color/CSS ...
    const editorHtml = normalizeEditorHtml(preset.editorHtml, preset.color);
    activeEditor.resetContent(editorHtml);
    const sourceToggle = activeEditor.plugins[SOURCE_TOGGLE_PLUGIN_NAME] as
      | SourceTogglePluginApi
      | undefined;
    if (sourceToggle?.isSourceMode()) sourceToggle.replaceAll(editorHtml);
    syncThemeColorFromEditor();
    applyEditorTheme(activeEditor);
    void refreshAll();
  }
  ```
  **Problem**: Calls `resetContent()` (line 1267) and syncs in source mode but **does not trigger stylesheet injection**.

---

### 2. **Plugins/tinymce-codemirror: Source Mode Implementation & Live Preview**

**File**: [plugins/tinymce/codemirror/src/index.ts](plugins/tinymce/codemirror/src/index.ts)

**Key Details:**

- **Line 102-117** — `SourceTogglePluginOptions` interface:
  ```typescript
  export interface SourceTogglePluginOptions {
    strings?: Partial<CodemirrorStrings>;
    height: number;
    extensions?: Extension[];  // Panel for pantokenHtmlLinter, pantokenHtmlCompletion
    onChange?: (doc: string) => void;  // Called on every doc change in source mode
    onToggle?: (sourceMode: boolean) => void;
    display?: "toolbar" | "footer" | "both";
  }
  ```

- **Line 128-137** — `SourceTogglePluginApi` interface (what `editor.plugins[SOURCE_TOGGLE_PLUGIN_NAME]` exposes):
  ```typescript
  export interface SourceTogglePluginApi {
    isSourceMode(): boolean;
    getContent(): string;
    insertAtCursor(content: string): void;
    replaceAll(content: string): void;
    format(): Promise<void>;
  }
  ```

- **Line 200-230** — Source view setup (CodeMirror in a separate `<div>` next to the editor iframe):
  ```typescript
  const ensureSourceView = (): EditorView => {
    if (sourceView) return sourceView;
    const container = document.createElement("div");
    container.style.cssText =
      "display: none; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; overflow: auto; border: 1px solid; font-size: 13px;";
    editor.contentAreaContainer.insertAdjacentElement("afterend", container);
    sourceContainer = container;
    sourceView = new EditorView({
      extensions: [
        basicSetup,
        html(),
        EditorView.lineWrapping,
        themeCompartment.of(...),
        EditorView.updateListener.of((update): void => {
          if (update.docChanged) onChange?.(update.state.doc.toString());
        }),
        ...extensions,
      ],
      parent: container,
    });
    applyContainerChrome();
    // ... MutationObserver for scheme ...
    return sourceView;
  };
  ```
  **Key point**: Source view is a **separate CodeMirror instance** in its own DOM container, **NOT an iframe**. Uses `onChange` callback to notify of edits.

- **Line 242-255** — Toggle behavior (switches visibility, syncs content, fires `setContent`):
  ```typescript
  const toggle = (onActiveChange?: (active: boolean) => void): void => {
    sourceMode = !sourceMode;
    onActiveChange?.(sourceMode);
    const view = ensureSourceView();
    const contentArea = editor.contentAreaContainer;
    if (sourceMode) {
      replaceDoc(editor.getContent());
      contentArea.style.display = "none";
      sourceContainer!.style.display = "block";
      view.focus();
      void format();
    } else {
      contentArea.style.display = "";
      sourceContainer!.style.display = "none";
      editor.setContent(view.state.doc.toString());  // ← Fires SetContent event
    }
    for (const listener of sourceModeListeners) listener(sourceMode);
    onToggle?.(sourceMode);
  };
  ```

- **Line 232-236** — `replaceDoc` (used when switching to source mode):
  ```typescript
  const replaceDoc = (content: string): void => {
    const view = ensureSourceView();
    view.dispatch({ changes: { from: 0, to: view.state.doc.length, insert: content } });
  };
  ```

- **No live preview in source mode** — The CodeMirror view is just **syntax-highlighted HTML text**. The `onChange` callback is used in `main.ts.tmpl` (line 928) to trigger `syncIconAssetsFromEditor()` and `refreshAll()`, which updates the **external preview pane**, not the source view itself.

- **Main.ts integration** (line 918-928):
  ```typescript
  createSourceTogglePlugin({
    strings: tinymceStrings,
    height: EDITOR_HEIGHT_PX,
    display: "footer",
    extensions: [
      pantokenHtmlLinter({ ... }),
      pantokenHtmlCompletion({ ... }),
    ],
    onChange: () => {
      syncThemeColorFromEditor();
      if (syncIconAssetsFromEditor()) void refreshAll();
      debouncedUpdatePreview();
    },
    onToggle: () => void refreshAll(),
  }),
  ```

---

### 3. **renderers/tinymce/src/content-css.ts: injectContentStylesheet Idempotency & Removal**

**File**: [renderers/tinymce/src/content-css.ts](renderers/tinymce/src/content-css.ts)

- **Line 28-34** — `injectContentStylesheet` function:
  ```typescript
  export function injectContentStylesheet(editor: Editor, url: string): void {
    const head = editor.getDoc().head;
    if (head.querySelector(`link[href="${url}"]`)) return;  // ← Idempotent check
    const link = editor.getDoc().createElement("link");
    link.rel = "stylesheet";
    link.href = url;
    head.append(link);
  }
  ```
  **Idempotency**: Checks for **exact URL match** via `querySelector` — if the same URL exists, it's a no-op. **No removal mechanism** — stale links stay.

- **Line 42-59** — `trackAndInjectAsset` (used by picker plugins):
  ```typescript
  export function trackAndInjectAsset(
    editor: Editor,
    cssFile: CdnFile,
    target: {
      currentAssets: CdnFile[];
      onMissingAsset?: MissingAssetHandler;
      buildAssetUrl?: (file: CdnFile) => string;
    },
  ): void {
    if (!target.currentAssets.find((a) => a.path === cssFile.path)) {
      target.currentAssets.push(cssFile);
      target.onMissingAsset?.(cssFile);
    }
    const cssUrl = (target.buildAssetUrl ?? buildFileUrl)(cssFile);
    injectContentStylesheet(editor, cssUrl);
  }
  ```
  This is the function called by icon/logo/component **pickers** to sync assets.

- **No iframe recreation detected** — TinyMCE does **not** recreate the iframe on fullscreen (fullscreen state is toggled via CSS `display: none/block` on the iframe container). Injected `<link>` elements persist in the iframe's `<head>`.

---

### 4. **Pantoken Plugin Asset Handling for SetContent / PastePostProcess**

**File**: [renderers/tinymce/src/plugins/icons.ts](renderers/tinymce/src/plugins/icons.ts)

- **Line 54-58** — Insert path (triggered only by picker, not by paste/SetContent):
  ```typescript
  function insertIcon(editor: Editor, icon: TaggedIcon, options: IconsPickerOptions): void {
    insertHtml(editor, buildIconMarkup(icon));
    trackAndInjectAsset(editor, getIconCdnFile(icon), options);  // ← Calls injectContentStylesheet
  }
  ```

**No `PastePostProcess` or `SetContent` handlers** detected in:
- [renderers/tinymce/src/plugins/icons.ts](renderers/tinymce/src/plugins/icons.ts)
- [renderers/tinymce/src/plugins/logos.ts](renderers/tinymce/src/plugins/logos.ts)
- [renderers/tinymce/src/plugins/components.ts](renderers/tinymce/src/plugins/components.ts)

These plugins **only inject when a picker explicitly inserts an asset**.

---

### 5. **Logos List & Products Filtering (Line ~869)**

**File**: [packages/scaffold/templates/canvas-theme-editor/src/main.ts.tmpl](packages/scaffold/templates/canvas-theme-editor/src/main.ts.tmpl)

- **Line 124-128** — Imports from `@pantoken/tinymce`:
  ```typescript
  logos,
  PANTOKEN_ICON,
  PANTOKEN_ICON_PACK_NAME,
  products,
  ```

- **Line 870-877** — Logos picker configuration (passed to `createPantokenPlugin`):
  ```typescript
  logos: {
    logos,
    products,
    currentAssets,
    onMissingAsset,
    buildAssetUrl: buildSelectedAssetUrl,
  },
  ```

- **How `products` is used** — In [renderers/tinymce/src/plugins/logos.ts](renderers/tinymce/src/plugins/logos.ts), line 64-72:
  ```typescript
  const productItems = options.products.map((p) => ({
    text: p,
    value: p,
  }));

  const _dialog = editor.windowManager.open({
    title: strings.logosDialogTitle,
    body: {
      type: "panel",
      items: [
        {
          type: "selectbox",
          name: "product",
          label: strings.logosProductLabel,
          items: productItems,  // ← Direct product list
        } as any,
  ```

- **Filtering 'pantoken' product** — To exclude it for the scaffold, filter `products` before line 870:
  ```typescript
  const visibleProducts = products.filter(p => p !== 'pantoken');
  // Then pass visibleProducts to createPantokenPlugin
  ```

**Source**: `products` is re-exported from [@pantoken/plugin-logos](renderers/tinymce/src/logos.ts#L13) — type `Product` (union of product strings).

---

### 6. **Test Coverage**

**Canvas-Theme-Editor Tests**: [packages/scaffold/tests/index.test.ts](packages/scaffold/tests/index.test.ts)
- Line 65-76 — Expects `syncIconAssetsFromEditor`, `createSourceTogglePlugin`, `buildAssetUrl: buildSelectedAssetUrl` in generated main.ts
- No tests for stylesheet injection on paste/preset-restore/SetContent

**TinyMCE Renderer Tests**:
- [renderers/tinymce/tests/content-css.test.ts](renderers/tinymce/tests/content-css.test.ts) — Tests `injectContentStylesheet` idempotency (line 21-34) but **not injection on content change**
- [renderers/tinymce/tests/icons.test.ts](renderers/tinymce/tests/icons.test.ts) — Line 137-150 tests `getUsedIconCdnFiles` deduplication but **not pickerless asset detection**
- [renderers/tinymce/tests/icons-picker.test.ts](renderers/tinymce/tests/icons-picker.test.ts) — Tests picker insertion, mocks editor.getDoc() but **no tests for pasted/restored icons**
- [renderers/tinymce/tests/logos-picker.test.ts](renderers/tinymce/tests/logos-picker.test.ts) — Similar; tests picker but **not restored logos from preset**

**Codemirror Plugin Tests**: [plugins/tinymce/codemirror/tests/source-toggle.test.ts](plugins/tinymce/codemirror/tests/source-toggle.test.ts)
- Line 81-96 — Tests `onChange` callback fires during edits, but **no assertions on stylesheet sync**
- Line 144-178 — Tests toggling, formatting, but **not CSS injection for source-mode content**

---

### Summary of Gaps

| Scenario | Problem | Missing |
|----------|---------|---------|
| **Picker insertion** | ✅ Works | — |
| **Paste content** | ❌ No injection | No `PastePostProcess` handler |
| **Preset restore** | ❌ No injection | `restoreCanvasThemePreset()` syncs `currentAssets` only for preview |
| **Draft restore** | ❌ No injection | Post-init `syncIconAssetsFromEditor()` updates preview, not iframe |
| **SetContent event** | ⚠️ Partial | Handler on line 1980 fires `syncIconAssetsFromEditor()` but doesn't **call `trackAndInjectAsset()`** |
| **resetContent()** | ❌ No injection | No event handler |
| **HTML source mode** | ❌ No iframe injection | Source mode is CodeMirror overlay; external preview gets CSS, but iframe-editing in WYSIWYG-view doesn't |

